harudlg v1

dialogue en-US study Akioki
branch study_notes
line "Notebook first. Harufushi keeps the chair warm."
line "One clean note now saves three confused commits later."
line "The evening route stays quiet, but the day has a spine."

dialogue en-US study Akioki
branch exam_thread
when study >= 24
line "The same paragraph finally stops sliding away."
line "Harufushi taps the margin twice, then writes a tiny star beside your summary."
line "A study route opens: prototype notes, then a patch plan before sleep."

dialogue en-US modding Harufushi
branch routine_patch
line "The preview window blinked again."
line "Touch one UI edge at a time, or the patch queue will bite back."
line "Tonight's route stays in polish work: small fixes, visible results."

dialogue en-US modding Harufushi
branch release_candidate
when mod >= 35
when energy >= 20
line "The build light finally turned green."
line "Harufushi leans over the log and whispers the forbidden words: release candidate."
line "A new branch opens around screenshots, changelog notes, and one risky late patch."

dialogue en-US harufushi Harufushi
branch quiet_bond
line "You closed the editor before dinner. I saw that."
line "Stay here for a minute. The build can wait."
line "The route turns softer: fewer commits, more eye contact."

dialogue en-US harufushi Harufushi
branch dependence_lock
when bond >= 20
when dependence >= 8
line "Do not pretend this is just pair programming."
line "Harufushi keeps your sleeve between two fingers, gentle enough to deny everything."
line "A dependence route opens, and every future choice will ask how close is too close."

dialogue en-US rest Akioki
branch clean_rest
line "No heroic all-nighter today."
line "Sleep is also dependency management."
line "Tomorrow's route will remember that you did not burn the day down."

dialogue en-US rest Akioki
branch recovery_day
when energy <= 35
line "The screen glow has gone sour."
line "You close the laptop before the error list starts sounding personal."
line "A recovery route opens: fewer rewards today, but no collapse tomorrow."

dialogue zh-CN study 秋起
branch study_notes
line "先记笔记。春伏已经把椅子占暖了。"
line "现在理清一个概念，晚上就少改三次提交。"
line "今天的路线暂时安静，但至少有了骨架。"

dialogue zh-CN study 秋起
branch exam_thread
when study >= 24
line "同一段文字终于不再从脑子里滑走。"
line "春伏在页边轻轻敲了两下，又给你的总结画了一颗小星星。"
line "学习线展开：先把原型笔记整理完，睡前再拆补丁计划。"

dialogue zh-CN modding 春伏
branch routine_patch
line "预览窗口又闪了一下。"
line "一次只动一个 UI 边界，不然补丁队列会反咬你。"
line "今晚先走润色线：改动小一点，反馈明确一点。"

dialogue zh-CN modding 春伏
branch release_candidate
when mod >= 35
when energy >= 20
line "构建灯终于绿了。"
line "春伏凑到日志旁边，小声说出那个危险词：候选发布。"
line "新故事线展开：截图、更新说明，还有一个很想插队的深夜补丁。"

dialogue zh-CN harufushi 春伏
branch quiet_bond
line "你居然在晚饭前关了编辑器，我看见了。"
line "在这里坐一分钟，构建可以等。"
line "今天的路线变软了一点：提交少一些，对视多一些。"

dialogue zh-CN harufushi 春伏
branch dependence_lock
when bond >= 20
when dependence >= 8
line "别装成这只是结对编程。"
line "春伏用两根手指牵住你的袖口，轻到足够让人继续嘴硬。"
line "依存线展开，之后每个选择都会追问：靠得太近是从哪里开始的。"

dialogue zh-CN rest 秋起
branch clean_rest
line "今天不搞通宵英雄主义。"
line "睡觉也是依赖管理。"
line "明天的路线会记得你今天没有把自己烧穿。"

dialogue zh-CN rest 秋起
branch recovery_day
when energy <= 35
line "屏幕光已经发涩了。"
line "你在错误列表开始像是在骂人之前合上电脑。"
line "恢复线展开：今天奖励少一点，但明天不会崩。"

dialogue ja-JP study アキオキ
branch study_notes
line "まずノート。ハルフシが椅子を温めている。"
line "今ひとつ整理すれば、夜のコミットが三回減る。"
line "今日のルートは静かだが、芯はできた。"

dialogue ja-JP study アキオキ
branch exam_thread
when study >= 24
line "同じ段落が、ようやく頭からこぼれなくなった。"
line "ハルフシが余白を二度たたき、要約の横に小さな星を描く。"
line "勉強ルートが開く。原型ノート、それから眠る前のパッチ計画。"

dialogue ja-JP modding ハルフシ
branch routine_patch
line "プレビュー画面がまた光った。"
line "UIの境界は一度にひとつだけ。パッチ列が噛み返すよ。"
line "今夜は調整ルート。小さく直して、確実に見える結果へ。"

dialogue ja-JP modding ハルフシ
branch release_candidate
when mod >= 35
when energy >= 20
line "ビルドランプがやっと緑になった。"
line "ハルフシがログをのぞき込み、禁句をささやく。リリース候補。"
line "新しいルートが開く。スクショ、更新メモ、そして深夜の危ない追加パッチ。"

dialogue ja-JP harufushi ハルフシ
branch quiet_bond
line "夕食前にエディタを閉じたね。見てたよ。"
line "ここで一分だけ座って。ビルドは待てる。"
line "今日のルートは少し柔らかい。コミットより、目を合わせる時間。"

dialogue ja-JP harufushi ハルフシ
branch dependence_lock
when bond >= 20
when dependence >= 8
line "これをただのペア作業って言うつもり？"
line "ハルフシは袖を二本の指でつまむ。否定できるくらい、やさしく。"
line "依存ルートが開く。近すぎる、はどこから始まったのか。"

dialogue ja-JP rest アキオキ
branch clean_rest
line "今日は徹夜の英雄ごっこなし。"
line "眠ることも依存関係の管理だ。"
line "明日のルートは、今日燃え尽きなかったことを覚えている。"

dialogue ja-JP rest アキオキ
branch recovery_day
when energy <= 35
line "画面の光が苦くなってきた。"
line "エラー一覧が人格攻撃に見える前に、ノートPCを閉じる。"
line "回復ルートが開く。今日の報酬は少ないが、明日は壊れない。"
